<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ekran 6-mth net rises 70 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ekran 6-mth net rises 70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  78.68   vs	  46.18</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 30.6    vs	  18.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   352.96   vs	 260.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   120.69   vs	  72.71</p>
<p>NOTE - Ekran Bhd is involved in investment holding, infrastructure construction and property development.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
